            "notes": "For Round 2 I like to get  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) as it gives 5% weapon power as well as 15% extra attack speed when you do damage which pairs well with  [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) \n\nIf you have enough you can also get  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for extra damage or  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and whatever else you can afford. You should try to go after a balance in attack speed and damage.",
