            "created_at": "2025-08-25T11:35:47.512621+00:00",
            "notes": "For this round i like to keep what we have and try to get  [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) as it pairs well with  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66), as long as youre doing damage (which is easy when you have  [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) youll be gaining an extra 25% attack speed. \n\nDepending on how much money you have i would say to sell  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and get  [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) as the more bullets you can shoot, the more damage per second youre able to do.\n\nIf you REALLY want to you can swap out  [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) for  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) if you want the extra attack speed at all times.",
